\par
\textbf{Fig 1. Learning in adaptive management. }Technical learning involves an iterative sequence of decision
\par
making, monitoring, assessment, and feedback of what is learned into decision making. Institutional learning
\par
involves periodic reconsideration of the components in decision making (Williams and Brown [5]).
\par
