\par
other year. We acknowledge that other cadences are possible and could be considered. But we
\par
believe that the 4 scenarios developed here serve to highlight relevant patterns.
\par
We first summarize the technical framework for adaptive decision making, and then
\par
describe value functions for each of 4 scenarios. For each scenario we describe optimal valua-
\par
tions and policies under both active and passive adaptive management.
